# FP-reasoning: HIGH, plain. CVE-2022-46169 Cacti unauth command injection via
# the remote-agent poller (X-Forwarded-For bypasses IsRemoteAgent, then
# action=polldata + local_data_ids[] passes attacker input to proc_open).
# Clean-room from advisory. Scope http.uri (the path + params arrive there).
# fast_pattern "/remote_agent.php" -> attacker-targeted endpoint. pcre requires
# the exploit's parameter combination (action=polldata + local_data_ids[]).
# Negative: a normal Cacti /remote_agent.php fetch (no polldata+local_data_ids)
# -> reaches pcre, rejected -> silent (§19 T6).
